Sûr gul li baxan e barê, sûr gul li baxan e barê.
 
The red rose in the gardens is blooming, the red rose in the
gardens is blooming.

302
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:30,000
Gula wê gundê han e, gula wê gundê han e.
 
Its flower is from that village, its flower is from that
village.

303
