Çûm Çûm Efrînê canê, Hatin Efrînê canê.
 
I went, went to Afrin, my dear, They came to Afrin, my dear.

304
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:51,000
Çûm Çûm Efrînê canê, Hatin Efrînê canê.
 
I went, went to Afrin, my dear, They came to Afrin, my dear.

305
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:56,000
Biharê hêşîn e berek, lê lê hêşîn e berek.
 
Spring is green here, oh oh it is green here.

306
00:25:56,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Gula wê nazdar berek, gula wê nazdar berek.
 
Its flower is delicate here, its flower is delicate here.

307
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:18,000
Hatin va malê dîtin, çûne malê dîtin.
 
They came to see this house, they went to see the house.

308
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:34,000
Hatin va malê dîtin, çûne malê dîtin.
 
They came to see this house, they went to see the house.

309
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:40,000
Bûk û zengil li hev ketin, zengil û zengil li hev xistin.
 
The bride and bells met, they rang the bell and bell
together.

310
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:55,000
Bûk û zengil li hev ketin, zengil û zengil li hev xistin.
 
The bride and bells met, they rang the bell and bell
