goes onto the scale and the net weight comes to us.

390
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:32,000
Herî...
 
Yes...

391
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:34,000
Herî o, em ton bi çendê difirotin, ya bavo can?
 
Yes, so for how much do you sell a ton, dear father?

392
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:38,000
Ton, ji dused û dehan dolaran dest pê dike, heta dused û
